SUMMARY:Astrology Workshop: Pluto Alchemy with Senseful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for a deeper dive into your Pluto
  placement in astrology.\n\nWe’ll cover the generational themes of each 
 of the pluto transits and how to alchemize your pluto placement.\n\nNote: 
 Bring your chart if you have it or we can help when you arrive. Birth time
 s increase accuracy but are not required.\n\nJenn has been a practicing As
 trologer for 7+ years and offers Astrology readings live @energeticexperie
 nces select days.\n\nPersonal Virtual Readings Available at: [sensefulwell
 ness.com](http://sensefulwellness.com/)\n\nDonations accepted.
